{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42165","headline":"宣威苗将军贬官後重经故宅 · 徐铉","name":"宣威苗将军贬官後重经故宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒋山南望近西坊，亭馆依然锁院墙。\n天子未尝过细柳，将军寻已戍炖煌。\n敧倾怪石山无色，零落圆荷水不香。\n爲将爲儒皆寂寞，门前愁杀马中郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}